   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Identity & secrets: Entra ID · managed identities · Key Vault · Teams application access policy · Dataverse application user (least privilege)\nNetwork & data: Private Link / VNet · APIM + WAF for webhooks · immutable raw zone · Purview labels & retention · region / data-zone control\nConfig & operations: versioned templates, taxonomy & thresholds (Sales Ops-owned) · Azure Monitor / App Insights · DLQ + replay · IaC + CI/CD · golden-set evals · Power BI KPIs",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "Identity & secrets: Entra ID · managed identities · Key Vault · Teams application access policy · Dataverse application user (least privilege)\nNetwork & data: Private Link / VNet · APIM + WAF for webhooks · immutable raw zone · Purview labels & retention · region / data-zone control\nConfig & operations: versioned templates, taxonomy & thresholds (Sales Ops-owned) · Azure Monitor / App Insights · DLQ + replay · IaC + CI/CD · golden-set evals · Power BI KPIs",
